gxde-kwin-x11 for Debian
------------------------

This fork is packaged under its own namespace and does not declare Conflicts,
Breaks or Replaces against the distribution KWin packages. It is intended to
be co-installable with both the X11 and Wayland variants of upstream KWin.

The source still compiles shared Wayland protocol and support code used by the
KWin core library. This is not a Wayland compositor build: neither
kwin_wayland nor gxde-kwin_wayland is a CMake target or an installed file.

The package build disables upstream tests and explicitly enables only the
gxde-kwin_x11 executable backend.
